rows.en:
Normally that would've been enough for her to give up, but Suzuki had asked her out once, right?
Even if it vanished in an instant.
That made her even sadder.{p}

Hmm.
Personality next, huh.
So faces don't matter to you at all?{p}

Nope, that's not it.
Not an incoming first-year.
It was a new teacher.{p}

"I-I forgot☆
I've forgotten all about that☆"
Mr. Kondo screamed at the top of his lungs.{p}

There was no one outside the door.
He let out a sigh of relief.
But just as he went to close the door...{p}

Then Hirai yanked hard on Mr. Kondo's arm.
She was trying to drag him outside.
Mr. Kondo fought back desperately.{p}

With his own arm still sticking outside, he tried to slam the door again and again.
"Uwaaagh☆
Uwaaagh☆"{p}

Mr. Kondo's arm was caught in the door, and a dull crunch echoed all around.
Maybe he didn't even know what he was doing.
He was just so terrified of her...{p}
